       whole grid and resize the preview iframe — a visible redraw on every toggle. 320px fits a
       token row and leaves the component list roomy. */
    grid-template-columns: 320px 1fr 320px;
    /* Fills what the identity bar leaves. min-height:0 so the three panes scroll inside the
